  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the institutional capacities of the Competition Council to enforce the competition and state aid policy in line with the EU best practices</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective is to enhance the internal market in Moldova by facilitating the effective implementation and enforcement of Competition and State Aid policies in line with the EU-Republic of Moldova Association Agreement, relevant European acquis, the EU Integration process, and international agreements and ensure fair competition, foster market integrity, and safeguard consumer welfare in the Republic of Moldova.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
